meta {
  name: 10 - Reject Duplicate Transfer Request
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/store/orders/{{transferOrderId}}/transfer/request
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{customerToken}}
}

tests {
  test("400 Bad Request (duplicate pending change)", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(400);
  });
}

docs {
  # 10 - Reject Duplicate Transfer Request

  Kiem thu ranh gioi nghiep vu: Khach hang co tinh spam hoac gui lai yeu cau chuyen giao tren cung mot don hang khi yeu cau cu van dang o trang thai `requested` (chua duoc duyet/chua bi huy).
  Medusa v2 phai chan dung voi HTTP 400 Bad Request vi don hang dang co mot `order_change` ton tai chua hoan tat.
}
